<title>USA: Chile's CTC says considering merger.</title>
<headline>Chile's CTC says considering merger.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compania de Telecomunicaciones de Chile SA said late Tuesday that it is considering a merger with VTR SA, a Chilean telecommunications company.</p>
<p>The company's board of directors had authorised management to continue discussions with VTR, it said.</p>
<p>VTR is involved in local and long distance telephone services and cable television.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
